==Strategy==
===Chapter 1===
Since this level lacks a threat on its own, and the base's health is very low, you can rush using [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] with the help of [[Zombie Killer]]s to clear the way.

===Chapter 2===
The game still has mercy on you, and that's why the Wild Doges aren't at 200%, so you can use the same strategy of rushing with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], just pairing it with [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]] for the Star Pengs and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] for the Wild Doges.

===Chapter 3===
The inclusion of Relic Doge and  Formicidaean Ariant doesn't change the level much, so you can keep using the same strategy from the previous 2 chapters.

